  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "1. Platform Overview",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1. Platform Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 22.99,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "PrimeInspect is an inspection and audit management platform built by Tecsack Software. It",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1. Platform Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "gives organizations a configurable way to define inspection templates, schedule them across",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1. Platform Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "sites and equipment, assign them to field users, and capture the results — including photo,",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1. Platform Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "video, and signature evidence — through to a finished report.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1. Platform Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "The platform is industry-agnostic by design: the type of equipment being inspected, the checklist",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1. Platform Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "content, and the inspection frequency are all configured per customer account rather than being",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1. Platform Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "built for one specific industry. This makes it suitable for facilities management, equipment",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1. Platform Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "maintenance, and safety or compliance auditing programs alike.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1. Platform Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "PrimeInspect is delivered as a backend API platform (ASP.NET Web API on .NET 9) that",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1. Platform Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "powers mobile and web client applications used by administrators and field inspection teams.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "1. Platform Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "2. Workflow",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "2. Workflow"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 22.99,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "At a high level, an administrator builds a reusable inspection template, schedules it against the",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "2. Workflow"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "relevant sites and assets, and field users complete it on location. Findings that fail or are",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "2. Workflow"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "flagged during an inspection can be escalated into a tracked follow-up ticket.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "2. Workflow"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
